CLOCK_CONF_SECOND named SYS_TICK_HZ without including the header that
defines it. Now clock-arch.h holds the number and rtl837x_common.h takes
SYS_TICK_HZ from there, so a file that uses CLOCK_SECOND needs nothing
else.
